337</span><span class=\"of-s\">$337 through <a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"name:VTI\">VTI</a></span></span></div><h3 class=\"sub\">Profile</h3><div class=\"profile\"><p>BlackRock is the largest asset manager in the world, with $15.345 trillion in assets under management at the end of June 2026. Its product mix is diverse, with 58% of managed assets in equity strategies, 22% in fixed income, 9% in multi-asset classes, 7% in money market funds, and 4% in alternatives. Passive strategies account for two-thirds of long-term AUM, with the company&#x27;s ETF platform maintaining a leading market share domestically and on a global basis. Product distribution is weighted more toward institutional clients, which, by our calculations, account for around 80% of AUM. BlackRock is geographically diverse, with clients in more than 100 countries and more than one-third of managed assets coming from investors domiciled outside the US and Canada.</p><button class=\"linkish\" type=\"button\" data-more>More</button></div><dl class=fields><dt>Industry</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"industry:capital-markets\">Capital Markets</a></dd><dt>Country</dt><dd><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"country:US\">United States</a></dd></dl><h3 class=\"sub\">Betas</h3><table class=\"cmp \"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"n\">Beta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:1\">S&amp;P 500</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">1.13</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:2\">Long Treasury yield</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">0.14</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:3\">US dollar against major currencies</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.35</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:4\">Crude oil price</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.05</span></td></tr><tr><th><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"factor:5\">Semiconductor stocks</a></th><td class=n><span class=\"n v\">−0.16</span></td></tr><tr>